 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 1.4,
   "end": 3.215,
   "text": "Greetings CPL heroes!"
  },
  {
   "start": 3.215,
   "end": 6.45,
   "text": "Here's how CPL Initiative funding works for your college."
  },
  {
   "start": 8.25,
   "end": 10.14,
   "text": "Huge thanks to our Chancellor,"
  },
  {
   "start": 10.14,
   "end": 16.575,
   "text": "Board of Governors and the legislature for appropriating thirty-five million dollars to support CPL."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.575,
   "end": 19.945,
   "text": "About twenty-five million goes directly to the colleges,"
  },
  {
   "start": 19.945,
   "end": 24.72,
   "text": "while the remainder is funding CPL infrastructure and innovation projects."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.52,
   "end": 30.335,
   "text": "Each institution has a maximum allocation for the two-year period,"
  },
  {
   "start": 30.335,
   "end": 38.28,
   "text": "with smaller colleges eligible for base funding of one hundred fifty thousand and larger colleges capped at four hundred thousand dollars."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.28,
   "end": 41.33,
   "text": "The average is about two hundred fourteen thousand."
  },
  {
   "start": 44.73,
   "end": 47.86,
   "text": "Allocations are split between credit and noncredit shares,"
  },
  {
   "start": 47.86,
   "end": 49.59,
   "text": "so all students are supported."
  },
  {
   "start": 51.73,
   "end": 54.52,
   "text": "Funding is based on two priority outcomes."
  },
  {
   "start": 54.52,
   "end": 58.19,
   "text": "The access priority counts all applied, or articulated, CPL units,"
  },
  {
   "start": 58.19,
   "end": 62.386,
   "text": "whereas the completion priority counts transcribed CPL units."
  },
  {
   "start": 62.386,
   "end": 69.74,
   "text": "The Chancellor's Office will report on career attainment together with the infrastructure and innovation projects."
  },
  {
   "start": 71.54,
   "end": 75.94,
   "text": "Outcomes are measured in FTES and funded at half the reimbursement rate."
  },
  {
   "start": 81.14,
   "end": 84.2,
   "text": "Your college has its own target under each priority."
  },
  {
   "start": 84.2,
   "end": 88.055,
   "text": "Thirty semester units of CPL are counted as one FTES."
  },
  {
   "start": 88.055,
   "end": 92.52,
   "text": "For the average allocation, the Access target is about thirty-one FTES."
  },
  {
   "start": 92.52,
   "end": 98.342,
   "text": "Reach half the target, and your college qualifies for half the maximum funding."
  },
  {
   "start": 98.342,
   "end": 103.28,
   "text": "Colleges that achieve target for both priorities receive full funding."
  },
  {
   "start": 105.08,
   "end": 108.04,
   "text": "Before the Chancellor's Office releases any funding,"
  },
  {
   "start": 108.04,
   "end": 110.55,
   "text": "your college needs to meet three conditions:"
  },
  {
   "start": 110.55,
   "end": 115.22,
   "text": "name a CPL coordinator in MAP, confirm your participation,"
  },
  {
   "start": 115.22,
   "end": 120.85,
   "text": "and upload Joint Services Transcripts for at least seventy-five percent of enrolled veterans."
  },
  {
   "start": 120.85,
   "end": 124.84,
   "text": "Until then, the funding is held in reserve for the two-year period."
  },
  {
   "start": 126.64,
   "end": 129.785,
   "text": "The Chancellor's Office will release funding twice a year,"
  },
  {
   "start": 129.785,
   "end": 132.485,
   "text": "based on your college's CPL to date."
  },
  {
   "start": 132.485,
   "end": 135.42,
   "text": "The full two-year amount is available from year one,"
  },
  {
   "start": 135.42,
   "end": 137.94,
   "text": "and what remains carries forward to year two."
  },
  {
   "start": 139.74,
   "end": 141.175,
   "text": "You won't do this alone."
  },
  {
   "start": 141.175,
   "end": 144.3,
   "text": "Every priority comes with recommended strategies,"
  },
  {
   "start": 144.3,
   "end": 150.11,
   "text": "a CPL Initiative help team supports every college, and detailed guidance will follow."
  },
  {
   "start": 151.91,
   "end": 155.755,
   "text": "Find details on the CPL funding page and let's do this together."
  },
  {
   "start": 155.755,
   "end": 157.03,
   "text": "Our time is now!"
  }
 ]
